	/*
	 * Helper status / intent (2026-01-17)
	 *
	 * Situation:
	 * - The proof objective live in rvfi_insn_check.sv:
	 *     o_rd_wdata_match: spec_rd_wdata == rvfi_rd_wdata
	 *   guarded by (check && spec_valid && !spec_trap && !mem_fault).
	 * - RIC3 still gets stuck on hard transitions.
	 * - In the hard_trans VCDs, many RVFI/PC/data signals are irrelevant (appear as x),
	 *   meaning whatever their values hit the assertion.
	 *
	 * What we did (all helpers below are assertions, not assumptions):
	 * - Exposed PicoRV32’s RVFI/debug pipelining to the solver:
	 *     rvfi_pc_rdata == prev_dbg_insn_addr
	 *     rvfi_insn     == prev_dbg_insn_opcode
	 *     rvfi_insn     == uut.q_insn_opcode
	 *     rvfi_pc_wdata == uut.dbg_insn_addr
