	 *   observes the retiring instruction later than the internal decode flags.
	 * - Added “knownness” helpers for selected RVFI fields when (check && rvfi_valid)
	 *   using reduction-x checks (important because SVA treats X as failure).
	 * - Added an rd writeback alignment helper for the *writeback case* using 1-cycle
	 *   shadow regs: if last cycle had a non-IRQ cpuregs_write, then current RVFI rd_*
	 *   must reflect that write.
